#1800
The Wardwood Verge~
Ancient trees crowd close around The Wardwood Verge, their trunks
black-brown beneath curtains of moss and pale sapphire lichen. Small
branches turn without wind, following movement between the trunks. The
forest feels aware of every footfall, and the path ahead seems
permitted rather than truly open.
~
