The Warden's Clearing~
The canopy opens reluctantly around The Warden's Clearing, allowing
shafts of green and sapphire light to reach the forest floor. Wide
footprints pressed into the loam end beside trees whose roots are
shaped almost like toes. Even here, the Wardwood has the stillness of
a guarded hall rather than an untamed wilderness.
