#1825
The Deep Wardwood~
The Wardwood grows older and more hostile around The Deep Wardwood.
Massive trunks knot together overhead until daylight becomes a dim
green haze, while veins of sapphire radiance pulse in exposed roots.
Some trees bear half-formed faces that disappear when viewed from
another angle. Trespassers have clearly reached the Sanctum's
deliberate defenses.
~
