#1838
The Sapphire Gate~
The Sapphire Gate stands at the boundary between living forest and
deliberate wizardry. Pale stone rises through the roots without seam
or mortar, each surface traced with sapphire runes that brighten when
approached. Roots pass through the masonry as though stone and tree
were grown together from the same design. The Wardwood's guardians
have concentrated their strength here.
