#1850
The Sanctum Threshold~
The Sanctum Threshold lies within the Wizards' Sanctum, where polished
pale stone, dark sapphire, and impossible architecture replace the
wild forest. Sapphire lamps hover without chains, brightening when
someone studies the inscriptions beneath them. Every surface suggests
immense skill applied with equal parts scholarship, pride, and
paranoia.
